## Deployment

The project includes an Azure Pipeline (`azure-pipelines.yml`) that builds and tests the application. To deploy:

1. Push your code to Azure DevOps
2. Create a pipeline pointing to `azure-pipelines.yml`
3. Add deployment stages as needed for your environment
